{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And I will make you a kehal of peoples, and I will give the land.</b> At that time all the tribes had already been born except Benjamin, and He had already said to me when I departed from Paddan-aram: הָאָרֶץ אֲשֶׁר אַתָּה שׁוֹכֵב עָלֶיהָ לְךָ אֶתְּנֶנָּה וּלְזַרְעֶךָ (Genesis 28:13). If so, the intent was that He would give me a kahal of peoples in connection with inheriting the land. And one should not suppose that He said this only concerning you — that He would give me you and your two sons together."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:04.381316533Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}